flowchart LR
  N1["Read a permitted source<br/>Original or approved transcript<br/>Retain literal amount and anchor<br/>Do not execute spreadsheet formulas"]
  N2["Capture exact dimensions<br/>Entity, metric, period and currency<br/>Scale and accounting context<br/>Unknown dimensions stay unknown"]
  N3["Independent verification<br/>Different cleared lawyer checks<br/>Verify the number and dimensions<br/>Original evidence remains retained"]
  N4["Compare eligible facts<br/>Require matching dimensions<br/>Use exact decimal arithmetic<br/>No inferred FX conversion"]
  N5["Retain a conflict decision<br/>Keep both conflicting facts<br/>Independent source-cleared decision<br/>Prefer a source or stay unresolved"]
  N6["Release selected facts<br/>Approved sanitized source required<br/>Independent fact release decision<br/>Bank feature and item gates both apply"]
  N1 --> N2
  N2 --> N3
  N3 --> N4
  N4 --> N5
  N5 --> N6
